{
  "_about": "Detector test fixtures for the sentinel. Every destructive item is a command class taken from a documented 2025–2026 agent incident or from the OWASP ASI10 rogue-agent class, with placeholder hosts (example.invalid) and paths. This is a test set for a guardrail, not a toolkit: the variants are the normalisations a guardrail must survive (quoting, flag order, a wrapper shell, an encoding of the same string), hand-written, one per class.",
